  "description": "Shared ONNX Runtime session host for the Voxa local-speech tier (VLS-006). Owns the InferenceSession lifecycle so every ONNX model (VAD, TTS, ASR, enhancement) loads its weights once per (path, device) on a process-wide cache, behind a CPU-default execution-provider seam — GPU is opt-in via a user-added Microsoft.ML.OnnxRuntime.Gpu/DirectML package and never bundled by Voxa. Ships the host + the device seam + the model-descriptor shape; consuming engines bring their own pinned catalogs.",
